  "description": "OA-29 Stompin' Forward, player path with the REAL Stompa datasheet (fixture built from armies/recon_stomps.json): on take_and_hold_mirror_1 the Stompa (M10, 180mm) is teleported to open ground south-east of the corner ruin. Asserts: (a) the ability is detected from the unit's real meta.abilities; (b) a drag INTO the 5\" wall corner-ruin-balanced-left-46 is refused (>4\" blocks even Stompin' Forward) — no staged move, model stays put; (c) the 3\" generator-38 charges NO movement-distance penalty (pre-fix the +2\" difficult-ground +3.5\" climb tax made this 5.6\" hop illegal for M10); (d) a real drag onto the generator stages, confirms, and the model legally ends on the 3\" feature — legal ONLY via the 4\" step-over (a plain VEHICLE keyword-set is still blocked there).",
